@6011 = ~Fireburst~

@6012 = ~Fireburst (Evocation)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 5-foot radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell creates a fiery explosion centered on the caster, scorching all creatures within a 5-foot radius. All affected creatures suffer 1d3 points of fire damage per caster level, up to a maximum of 10d3. A successful save vs. spell reduces the damage by half.~

@6013 = ~Spell Shield~

@6014 = ~Spell Shield (Abjuration)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell conjures a small orb that orbits the caster, protecting him by absorbing all or part of the harmful effects of incoming spells. The caster gains a +1 bonus to saving throws vs. spell. A second orb appears when the caster reaches 8th level, and a third at 15th level, increasing the bonus to a maximum of +3 to saving throws vs. spell.~

@6015 = ~Déorie's Arcane Particles~

@6016 = ~Déorie's Arcane Particles (Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the wizard with shimmering particles charged with magical energy. The caster can harness these particles to empower every spell cast while the effect lasts, increasing the effective caster level of each spell by four. For example, a 1st-level wizard under the effects of this spell would cast Magic Missile as though he were 5th level, producing three missiles instead of one.~

@6017 = ~Flame Burst~

@6018 = ~Flame Burst (Evocation)

Level: 1
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell creates a sudden burst of flame at the designated point. Creatures within the area that fail a save vs. breath suffer 1d2 points of fire damage per caster level, to a maximum of 8d2.~

@6019 = ~Repulsion~

@60110 = ~Repulsion (Illusion)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell creates a wave of illusory energy that causes enemies within 5 feet to believe they have been pushed back. Those who fail their save vs. spell are actually driven back 30 feet and suffer 1d4+1 points of crushing damage.~

@60111 = ~Absence~

@60112 = ~Absence (Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell causes the caster to vanish completely. Spells already affecting him continue to function, but the caster himself is simply no longer there. For two rounds he cannot be targeted, harmed, or affected by any means.~

@60113 = ~Power Word: Halt~

@60114 = ~Power Word: Halt (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 1
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell reduces the target's movement rate to zero. The target may continue to act normally but cannot move for the duration of the spell, though teleportation remains possible. Creatures with fewer than 6 Hit Dice receive no saving throw. Creatures with 6 or more Hit Dice may attempt a save vs. spell to halve the duration.~

@6021 = ~Precision~

@6022 = ~Precision (Divination)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell sharpens the caster's accuracy, allowing the caster to more easily discern weaknesses in an opponent's defenses. The caster gains a +1 bonus to attack rolls, plus an additional +1 for every 5 caster levels, to a maximum of +5 at 20th level.~

@6023 = ~Energy Buffer~

@6024 = ~Energy Buffer (Necromancy)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell conjures a sphere of energy above the caster's head that absorbs a portion of the damage he would otherwise suffer, allowing the caster to withstand more punishment. The caster's maximum hit points increase by 5, plus 1 additional hit point for every 2 caster levels, to a maximum bonus of +15. This spell does not restore lost hit points if the caster is already wounded.~

@6025 = ~Flame Pulse~

@6026 = ~Flame Pulse (Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Casting Time: 3
Saving Throw: 1/2

Sold in a handful of shops in the Crucible and especially useful for clearing the cranium rats that infest its sewers, this spell allows the caster to create rings of fire that radiate outward, one each round. Each ring inflicts 2d4 points of fire damage upon all creatures within a 5-foot radius. A successful save vs. spell reduces the damage by half.~

@60269 = ~Flame Pulse (Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/2 levels
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Casting Time: 3
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell allows the wizard to create rings of fire that radiate outward from him, one each round. Each ring inflicts 2d4 points of fire damage upon all creatures within a 5-foot radius. A successful save vs. spell reduces the damage by half.~

@6027 = ~Serpent Strike~

@6028 = ~Serpent Strike (Alteration)

Level: 2
Range: Touch
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Creature touched
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the recipient the speed of a striking serpent. The target gains one additional attack per round. If the target already possesses the ability to backstab, its backstab multiplier is increased by +1.~

@6029 = ~Staff of Power~

@60210 = ~Staff of Power (Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a staff of pure magical energy in the caster's hands. The staff deals no physical damage and gains no benefit from the wielder's Strength. Instead, it deals magical energy damage based on the caster's level:

Level 3-6: +1 weapon, 2d4+1 damage
Level 7-10: 2d6+1 damage
Level 11-14: +2 weapon, 2d8+2 damage
Level 15-18: 2d10+2 damage
Level 19+: +3 weapon, 2d12+3 damage~

@60211 = ~Hexablades~

@60212 = ~Hexablades (Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

If the target fails its save vs. spell, six steel blades erupt from the ground beneath it. Each blade strikes once before vanishing. The damage dealt depends on the caster's level:

Level 3-6: 6d4 slashing damage
Level 7-10: 6d6 slashing damage
Level 11-14: 6d8 slashing damage
Level 15-18: 6d10 slashing damage
Level 19+: 6d12 slashing damage~

@60213 = ~Ultramagic Missile~

@60214 = ~Ultramagic Missile (Invocation)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature, special
Saving Throw: None

This spell launches a highly magical projectile at the target, dealing 2d6 points of magical damage. The projectile passes through the target, striking anything behind it, ricochets off walls, and ignores allies. The caster gains one additional projectile and may designate one additional target for every three levels beyond 3rd, up to a maximum of four projectiles and four targets at 12th level. All projectiles may instead be directed at a single target by selecting it repeatedly at the start of the targeting sequence.~

@60215 = ~Nix's Illusory Beast~

@60216 = ~Nix's Illusory Beast (Illusion)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

This spell creates a powerful and savage illusory beast. Nix's Illusory Beast can attack eight times per round with a THAC0 of 16. Each attack deals 2d6 points of magical damage if the target fails a save vs. spell (a successful save negates the damage). The beast vanishes if it suffers any damage.~

@602161 = ~Illusory Beast~

@60217 = ~Curse of the Swarm~

@60218 = ~Curse of the Swarm (Conjuration)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell invites all that crawls, creeps, and buzzes to feast upon the creatures chosen by the caster. All creatures within the area of effect are attacked by a swarm of insects. Those who succeed on a save vs. spell avoid the swarm. Those who fail suffer 1d4 points of piercing damage, plus 1 point for every 3 caster levels (to a maximum of 1d4+6), each round for 3 rounds, and are unable to cast spells for the duration.~

@60219 = ~Cow Fall~

@60220 = ~Cow Fall (Summoning)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 3 meter radius
Saving Throw: ½

Created by the mad Godol, this spell causes a cow to fall from the sky at the desired location. Upon hitting the ground, the cow explodes in a shower of burning flesh, creating a shockwave that spreads over a 3 meter radius. All creatures within the area suffer 2D6 points of crushing damage and 1D6 points of fire damage (a successful save vs. Breath reduces the damage by half). If a creature is standing directly at the point of impact, it suffers triple damage.

(Designer note: The cow fall animation is bugged in the EE versions and cannot display the impact area when this option is enabled.)~

@60221 = ~Tinker's Techniques~

@60222 = ~Tinker's Techniques (Divination)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell temporarily grants the spellcaster the knowledge required to set traps. He gains a bonus to his Set Traps skill equal to 10% + 2% per level (up to a maximum of 40%) and may attempt to set a trap at his current location. If successful, the trap will be identical to a normal thief trap, enhanced according to the level of the caster.

Beware: if the spellcaster fails to set the trap, there is a 25% chance that it will trigger against him instead.

Unless he has gained levels in a thief class, the spellcaster can only set one trap in each area.~

@60223 = ~Salyvia's Intense Gaze~

@60224 = ~Salyvia's IntenseGaze (Enchantment)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

Salyvia's mood swings are legendary among her friends. Naturally calm and gentle, Salyvia could fly into terrible rages following the slightest annoyance. Alabastine created this spell so that everyone could experience the power of Salyvia's gaze.

If the spell is cast on an ally, the target receives a +2 bonus to saving throws and attack rolls for one turn.

If the spell is cast on an enemy, the target is allowed a save vs. spells to resist the effect. If the saving throw is failed, the target is stunned for one round and suffers a -2 penalty to saving throws and attack rolls for one turn.

This spell has no effect if the spellcaster casts it on himself.~

@6022499 = ~Salyvia's Intense Gaze (Enchantment)

Level: 2
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

If the spell is cast on an ally, the target receives a +2 bonus to saving throws and attack rolls for one turn.

If the spell is cast on an enemy, the target is allowed a save vs. spells to resist the effect. If the saving throw is failed, the target is stunned for one round and suffers a -2 penalty to saving throws and attack rolls for one turn.

This spell has no effect if the spellcaster casts it on himself.~

@60225 = ~Torolonor's Painful Remembrance~

@60226 = ~Torolonor's Painful Remembrance (Alteration)
Level: 2
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the mage exhausts the physical barriers of their mind to recall spells already cast. This costs the mage 36 hit points and allows them to recall three 3rd-level spells.~

@6031 = ~Hachitoza's Instinctive Sight~

@6032 = ~Hachitoza's Instinctive Sight (Divination/Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the spellcaster the ability to instinctively detect and aim at the vulnerable points of his targets. The spellcaster gains a +3 bonus to attack rolls and a 15% bonus to his chance of scoring a critical hit.~

@6033 = ~Martial Prowess~

@6034 = ~Martial Prowess (Divination)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds maximum
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the spellcaster to temporarily access an extraordinary collection of martial knowledge gathered from the minds of countless warriors across a vast region. Upon completing the incantation, the spellcaster must choose one of the techniques revealed to him. For a short time, he gains the ability to use this technique as if he possessed the experience of a great warrior.~

@6035 = ~Claws of Misfortune~

@6036 = ~Claws of Misfortune (Necromancy)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell conjures three spectral claws that seize the target. The target suffers 3d6 points of piercing damage and is cursed, suffering a -2 penalty to saving throws, Armor Class, attack rolls, and movement. If the target fails a save vs. spells, it is also paralyzed for the duration of the spell.~

@6037 = ~Tenser's Deadly Strike~

@6038 = ~Tenser's Deadly Strike (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1d4+4 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

This spell greatly enhances the spellcaster's martial prowess. For the duration of the spell, every successful melee attack inflicts the maximum possible damage.~

@6039 = ~Bigdip's Immeasurable Strength~

@60310 = ~Bigdip's Immeasurable Strength (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: Touch
Duration: 11 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Creature touched
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the touched creature tremendous strength, though the enchantment quickly fades. The target gains a +8 bonus to Strength, which is reduced by 1 point each round thereafter. The bonus gradually disappears, becoming a -1 penalty on the 10th round and a -2 penalty on the 11th and final round.~

@60311 = ~Charged Weapon~

@60312 = ~Charged Weapon (Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Creature touched
Saving Throw: None

This spell charges the target's melee weapon with magical energy. The enchanted weapon inflicts an additional 1d6 points of magical damage with every successful hit. In addition, the weapon is treated as having a +2 enchantment bonus for the purpose of striking creatures requiring magical weapons, unless it already possesses an enchantment bonus of +2 or greater.~

@60313 = ~Nix's Tasty Little Chickens~

@60314 = ~Nix's Tasty Little Chickens (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 3
Range: 40 meters
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

This spell summons 1d4+1 chickens and fills them with magical energy. They possess no offensive abilities and serve only as decoys, but upon death, the magical energy within them creates a small toxic cloud. All creatures breathing the fumes must make a save vs. spells with a -2 penalty or become poisoned, suffering 1 point of damage per second for 3 rounds.~

@60315 = ~Resonant Note~

@60316 = ~Resonant Note (Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 4-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

After casting this spell, the bard can sing a deep note that is amplified into countless resonances affecting a small area. Creatures caught within the area suffer 10d6 points of nonlethal damage and are deafened and stunned for 3 rounds. A successful save vs. spells halves the damage and negates the stun, though the creatures remain deafened.

While deafened by this spell, creatures cannot be affected by sound-based spells (this spell, Ghostly Wail, Power Word: Resonance, and Wail of the Banshee).~

@60317 = ~Pandemonium Screaming Skull~

@60318 = ~Pandemonium Screaming Skull (Conjuration)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 1.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell hurls a screaming skull at the target. The skull relentlessly pursues its victim and cannot fail to strike. Upon impact, the target and all nearby creatures are subjected to the howling winds of Pandemonium.

These winds have the following effects:

- 100% chance to be deafened (save vs. spells at -6 negates).
- 75% chance to also be frightened (save vs. spells at -4 negates).
- 50% chance to also become confused (save vs. spells at -2 negates).
- 25% chance to fall into despair (save vs. spells negates).
- 10% chance to die of fright (save vs. spells at +2 negates).~

@60319 = ~Déorie's Wondrous Aura~

@60320 = ~Déorie's Wondrous Aura (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

The half-fairy Déorie created this spell merely to show off her fey heritage. Yet the results she obtained after testing her spell exceeded all her expectations. In addition to surrounding the spellcaster with a swirling cloud of fairy dust, the spell dispels lingering magical residue from the surrounding area, allowing spells to be cast more swiftly. The spellcaster's casting time is reduced by 2.

Déorie never discovered whether this unexpected benefit was due to her fey blood or to a misplaced rune in the spell's formula. It is now known that, since the effect applies to any spellcaster using Wondrous Aura, this remarkably useful spell owes its existence to nothing more than the fortunate mistake of a poorly written formula.~

@603209 = ~Déorie's Wondrous Aura (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the spellcaster with a swirling cloud of fairy dust and dispels lingering magical residue from the surrounding area. As a result, the spellcaster's spells are cast more swiftly. (Casting Time: -2)~

@60321 = ~Scourge of Fiends~

@60322 = ~Scourge of Fiends (Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1d4+2 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

When cast upon a fiend, this spell causes the creature's ichor to burst into flame. The target suffers 1d10 points of damage per spellcaster level, with a successful save vs. spells reducing the damage by half. A fiend that fails its saving throw is also stunned for 1d4+2 rounds.

This spell affects fiends only, but it was specifically designed to overcome their innate Magic Resistance. A fiend's Magic Resistance is treated as 15% lower against this spell.

Curiously, though this spell was created in the Blessed Fields of Elysium and is widely taught there, it proves even more versatile upon the Prime Material Plane, where it is equally effective against all fallen celestials.~

@60325 = ~Spell Theft~

@60326 = ~Spell Theft (Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: Touch
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell affects arcane spellcasters only and has no effect upon any other creature. If the target fails a save vs. spells, it immediately forgets one spell of the highest level it knows. At the same time, the spellcaster who cast Spell Theft regains one previously expended spell of up to 6th level.~

@60327 = ~A Step into Shadow~

@60328 = ~A Step into Shadow (Illusion)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: The caster
Casting Time: 3
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard partially steps into the Demiplane of Shadow. He becomes invisible and gains a +1 bonus to Armor Class, as well as a +20% bonus to Hide in Shadows and Move Silently. If his invisibility is dispelled, he need only remain motionless for 1 round to become invisible once more. This may be repeated at will until the spell is dispelled or its duration expires.~

@60329 = ~Acid Grasp~

@60330 = ~Acid Grasp (Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Casting Time: 3
Saving Throw: None

The spellcaster's hand becomes coated in a layer of corrosive acid. The acid does not harm the spellcaster, but prevents him from wielding weapons or using scrolls. If he strikes a creature with his acid-coated hand, it suffers 1d2 points of damage (plus the Strength bonus), in addition to 1d6 points of acid damage plus 1 point per 2 spellcaster levels, up to a maximum of 1d6+10 acid damage.~

@60331 = ~Gilispur's Boom-Boom Potions~

@60332 = ~Gilispur's Boom-Boom Potions (Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 24 hours
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Casting Time: 3
Saving Throw: None

Created by a wizard who knew how to enjoy himself, this spell reproduces the effects of pyrotechnic spells and condenses them into any ordinary waterskin, transforming it into a highly explosive concoction. A true cause for celebration!

Upon casting this spell, the spellcaster may create either a Boom-Boom Potion, a Hot-Fuzz Potion, or a Flashy-Flash Potion. The chosen potion appears in the spellcaster's inventory and remains usable for 24 hours before reverting to ordinary water. As a temporary magical item, it has no monetary value.~

@603321 = ~Boom-Boom Potion~

@603322 = ~Hot-Fuzz Potion~

@603323 = ~Flashy-Flash Potion~

@6033231 = ~Throw this potion to create a brilliant flash of light upon impact—certain to liven up any gathering.

PARAMETERS:

Effect: Blinds creatures for 3 rounds and stuns them for 1 round. A successful save vs. spell negates the stun, but the blindness cannot be avoided.
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius~

@60333 = ~Ambidexterity~

@60334 = ~Ambidexterity (Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 24 hours
Area of Effect: The caster
Casting Time: 7
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the caster to use his off hand with the same ease as his primary hand. It is as though he had never developed a preference for either hand. For the next 24 hours, the caster suffers no penalties whatsoever when fighting with two weapons.~

@60335 = ~Luck Theft~

@60336 = ~Luck Theft (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell steals from the target all the favorable twists of fate that might otherwise benefit it. If the target fails a save vs. spell, it suffers a -3 penalty to Luck and saving throws, while the caster gains a +3 bonus to Luck and saving throws.

This spell cannot stack on the same target.~

@60337 = ~Déorie's Swift Escape~

@60338 = ~Déorie's Swift Escape (Abjuration/Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 5 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

This spell was devised to allow a party of adventurers to make a swift escape from imminent danger. Upon casting, all allies within a 15-foot radius of the caster are protected by a special Sanctuary that cannot be dispelled by spells that detect or negate invisibility. In addition, they may move at three times their normal speed.

Any offensive action taken by a creature protected by this Sanctuary immediately ends the effect for that creature.~

@60339 = ~Energy Intensification~

@60340 = ~Energy Intensification (Alteration)

Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The spellcaster
Saving Throw: None

When casting this spell, the wizard must choose one type of elemental energy. For the duration of the spell, he inflicts 25% additional damage of that type. Starting at 15th level, he can also intensify magical energy.~

@603401 = ~Fire Intensification~

@603402 = ~Cold Intensification~

@603403 = ~Electrical Intensification~

@603404 = ~Acid Intensification~

@603405 = ~Magical Energy Intensification~

@60341 = ~Fit of Rage~

@60342 = ~Fit of Rage (Enchantment)

Level: 3
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

 
If the creature targeted by this spell fails a save vs. spell, it suffers a brief fit of rage that overwhelms its reason. For 4 rounds, it becomes berserk and attacks the nearest creature without regard for friend or foe.~

@6041 = ~Stroke of Luck~

@6042 = ~Stroke of Luck (Enchantment)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the target an extraordinary stroke of good fortune, forcing fate to favor its actions. The benefit is immense at first, but quickly fades as luck slips away.

During the first round, the target gains a +12 bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, damage, and critical hit chance.
During the second round, the target gains a +9 bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, damage, and critical hit chance.
During the third round, the target gains a +6 bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, damage, and critical hit chance.
During the fourth and final round, the target gains a +3 bonus to attack rolls, saving throws, damage, and critical hit chance.~

@6043 = ~Enervation~

@6044 = ~Enervation (Necromancy)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 8 hours
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

If the target fails a save vs. spell, it loses one experience level for every 4 caster levels, to a maximum of 5 levels at 20th level. Lost levels are restored after one full night's rest.~

@6045 = ~Nature's Communion~

@6046 = ~Nature's Communion (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: Variable
Casting Time: Variable
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Created upon Mount Olympus to allow a select few traveling wizards to benefit from the gifts of nature, this spell was never intended to exist upon the Prime Material Plane. Smuggling? An irreverent wizard? Only Agenor knows how such a scroll found its way into his shop.

This spell allows the wizard to enter into temporary communion with nature in the manner of a druid. Depending upon the caster's level, one of the following powers may be invoked:

Level 7-9: Entangle, Shapeshift: Wolf, Shapeshift: Brown Bear.
Level 10-12: Animal Summoning I, Summon Insects, Animal Spirit.
Level 13-15: Animal Summoning II, Call Woodland Beings, Shapeshift: Sword Spider.
Level 16+: Animal Summoning III, Insect Plague, Dolorous Decay.

Animal Spirit: This spell calls an animal spirit to merge with the caster. The bond with the spirit grants a bonus for 1 turn depending upon the chosen spirit:

Bull: +2 Strength and +3 Movement Rate.
Cat: +2 Dexterity and immunity to Web and Entangle.
Bear: +2 Constitution and +3 bonus to saves vs. poison and death.
Fox: +2 Intelligence and Detect Traps.
Owl: +2 Wisdom and Detect Invisibility.
Eagle: +2 Charisma and +4 bonus to ranged THAC0.~

@60469 = ~Nature's Communion (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: Variable
Casting Time: Variable
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to enter into temporary communion with nature in the manner of a druid. Depending upon the caster's level, one of the following powers may be invoked:

Level 7-9: Entangle, Shapeshift: Wolf, Shapeshift: Brown Bear.
Level 10-12: Animal Summoning I, Summon Insects, Animal Spirit.
Level 13-15: Animal Summoning II, Call Woodland Beings, Shapeshift: Sword Spider.
Level 16+: Animal Summoning III, Insect Plague, Dolorous Decay.

Animal Spirit: This spell calls an animal spirit to merge with the caster. The bond with the spirit grants a bonus for 1 turn depending upon the chosen spirit:

Bull: +2 Strength and +3 Movement Rate.
Cat: +2 Dexterity and immunity to Web and Entangle.
Bear: +2 Constitution and +3 bonus to saves vs. poison and death.
Fox: +2 Intelligence and Detect Traps.
Owl: +2 Wisdom and Detect Invisibility.
Eagle: +2 Charisma and +4 bonus to ranged THAC0.~

@60461 = ~Animal Spirit~

@6047 = ~Firebrands~

@6048 = ~Firebrands (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature per 2 levels
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell allows the wizard to hurl small bolts of fire that automatically strike their designated targets. The caster may select one target for every 2 caster levels, after which each target is struck by a firebrand that inflicts 2d6+1 points of fire damage. A successful save vs. spell reduces the damage by half.

It is also possible to direct every firebrand at a single target by selecting that target twice at the beginning of the targeting sequence.~

@604899 = ~Firebrands (Evocation)

