Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell allows the caster to hurl small bolts of fire that automatically strike their designated targets. The caster may select one target for every 2 caster levels, after which each target is struck by a firebrand that inflicts 2d6+1 points of fire damage. A successful save vs. spell reduces the damage by half.

It is also possible to direct every firebrand at a single target by selecting that target twice at the beginning of the targeting sequence.~

@6049 = ~Poison Nova~

@60410 = ~Poison Nova (Necromancy)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 10-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell creates a nova of poisonous energy at the designated location. Creatures within the area suffer 1d6 points of poison damage for every 2 caster levels (to a maximum of 10d6) and must make a save vs. poison or become poisoned, suffering an additional 2 points of poison damage each round.~

@6041099 = ~Poison Nova (Necromancy)

Level: 5
Sphere: Poison
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/2 levels
