This spell creates a nova of poisonous energy at the designated location. Creatures within the area suffer 1d6 points of poison damage for every 2 caster levels (to a maximum of 10d6) and must make a save vs. poison or become poisoned, suffering an additional 2 points of poison damage each round.~

@60411 = ~Greater Mirror Image~

@60412 = ~Greater Mirror Image (Illusion/Phantasm)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: The caster
Casting Time: 4
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a perfect reflection of the caster that moves at his side, mimicking his every action. Enemies attacking the wizard cannot distinguish the true caster from the illusion: each attack has a 50% chance to strike the image and a 50% chance to strike the wizard. The image disappears if the spell is dispelled or when its duration expires.~

@60413 = ~Bakanëo's Fantastic Reckoning~

@60414 = ~Bakanëo's Fantastic Reckoning (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 4
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: Special
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

The wild mage Bakanëo devised this spell during a period of profound despair. By altering Nahal's Reckless Dweomer to create ever more violent wild surges in the hope of finding the death he lacked the courage to seek himself, he inadvertently elevated the spell to an entirely new level.

This improved version of Nahal's spell allows the caster to shape chaotic energy into any known arcane spell, even if he possesses only the vaguest notion of what that spell is meant to accomplish.

However, the wild mage who casts this spell draws the tides of chaos irresistibly toward himself, suffering a -50 penalty on all Wild Surge table rolls both when casting the spell and for the next 1d10 rounds. It is therefore strongly recommended that this spell never be cast.

(This spell takes into account all mods that add new spells. If several such mods are installed, the list of spells to choose from may become veeeeeery long. To make things easier, spells are presented in descending spell-level order.)~

@604149 = ~Bakanëo's Fantastic Reckoning (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 4
Range: Special
Duration: Special
Casting Time: Special
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

This improved version of Nahal's spell allows the caster to shape chaotic energy into any known arcane spell, even if he possesses only the vaguest notion of what that spell is meant to accomplish.

However, the wild mage who casts this spell draws the tides of chaos irresistibly toward himself, suffering a -50 penalty on all Wild Surge table rolls both when casting the spell and for the next 1d10 rounds. It is therefore strongly recommended that this spell never be cast.~

@60415 = ~Phantasmal Killer~

@60416 = ~Phantasmal Killer (Illusion/Phantasm)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell conjures the most terrifying creature imaginable from the target's nightmares. If the target succeeds on a save vs. spell, it realizes that the apparition is merely an illusion and the spell ends. If the target fails its saving throw, the illusion becomes capable of killing it. The victim must immediately make a save vs. death or die on the spot. If it succeeds, the psychic shock is still so severe that it suffers 3d6 points of magical damage.~

@60417 = ~Keleg-Ze's Wrathful Fist~

@60418 = ~Keleg-Ze's Wrathful Fist (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: Neg.

Upon casting this spell, the wizard must clench his fist. It immediately bursts into flame, charged with primordial fire. Should the caster open his hand for any reason, the flames are extinguished and the spell is wasted. Consequently, the caster cannot cast spells while the spell remains in effect.

The caster has 2 rounds in which to strike an opponent with the charged fist. A successful hit inflicts 1d2 points of bludgeoning damage (plus the Strength bonus), and the victim must make a save vs. spell or suffer the spell's full fury. The stored energy erupts, dealing 1d12 points of fire damage per caster level, to a maximum of 20d12.

The spell ends immediately after a successful attack, whether or not the magical energy is discharged.~

@604181 = ~Charged Fist~

@60419 = ~Fairy Shield~

@60420 = ~Fairy Shield (Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Cast with the force of a commanding Power Word, this spell protects the caster from all hostile magic. Such is the spell's potency that it can endure only a few brief moments, making careful timing essential.~

@60421 = ~Electrical Conflagration~

@60422 = ~Electrical Conflagration (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell creates a large electrical conflagration at the designated location. All creatures within a 15-foot radius suffer 1d4 points of electrical damage per 2 caster levels, to a maximum of 10d4.

Creatures within the central 10-foot radius are struck by an additional 1d6 points of electrical damage per 2 caster levels, to a maximum of 10d6. Thus, creatures within the central area suffer both effects.

A successful save vs. spell reduces all damage by half.~

@60423 = ~Sandfall~

@60424 = ~Sandfall (Conjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

A massive cascade of sand crashes down upon the designated target. The target and all creatures within a 5-foot radius suffer 1d6 points of bludgeoning damage per caster level, to a maximum of 20d6. They are also blinded for 2 rounds and held for 1 round.

Creatures that succeed on a save vs. spell take only half damage and avoid being held, but the blindness cannot be avoided.~

@60425 = ~Protective Winds~

@60426 = ~Protective Winds (Conjuration)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: Special

By means of this spell, the wizard opens a gateway to the Elemental Plane of Air and calls forth mighty winds to shield him. The winds gather into a swirling barrier that surrounds the caster like a living suit of armor.

While protected, the caster is immune to wing buffet attacks, disperses all clouds and flames, gains 75% fire resistance, receives a +10 bonus to Armor Class against missile weapons, and a +2 bonus to Armor Class against all other attacks.

Furthermore, any creature approaching the caster must make a save vs. breath weapon or be hurled 30 feet backward by the raging winds.~

@60427 = ~Shifting Ground~

@60428 = ~Shifting Ground (Illusion/Phantasm)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

All enemies within the area of effect must make a save vs. spell. Those who fail become victims of a powerful illusion that alters their senses, making them believe that the ground is pitching violently beneath them, like the deck of a ship caught in a raging storm.

Affected creatures suffer a -4 penalty to attack rolls, Armor Class, and Dexterity, have a 15% chance of spell failure, and can make only one attack per round, regardless of their normal attacks per round.

In addition, each round they must make a save vs. breath weapon at a -4 penalty or collapse unconscious from overwhelming nausea.~

@60429 = ~Salyvia's Phantom Bow~

@60430 = ~Salyvia's Phantom Bow (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn/2 levels
Area of Effect: The caster
Casting Time: 4
Saving Throw: None

The renowned conjurer Salyvia devised this spell because she regretted being unable to use bows, weapons she had always greatly admired and long dreamed of wielding. Through this spell, the wizard conjures a magical bow of light blue color that can be used by a wizard without requiring any proficiency and weighs nothing. It appears in the wizard's hands and remains there for the duration of the spell.

The bow can fire three arrows per round. It creates its own phosphorescent arrows, which count as a +3 magical weapon, granting the wielder a +3 bonus to attack rolls and dealing 1d6+3 points of piercing damage plus 3 points of magical damage.~

@604309 = ~Salyvia's Phantom Bow (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn/2 levels
Area of Effect: The caster
Casting Time: 4
Saving Throw: None

This spell conjures a magical bow of light blue color that can be used by a wizard without requiring any proficiency and weighs nothing. It appears in the wizard's hands and remains there for the duration of the spell.

The bow can fire three arrows per round. It creates its own phosphorescent arrows, which count as a +3 magical weapon, granting the wielder a +3 bonus to attack rolls and dealing 1d6+3 points of piercing damage plus 3 points of magical damage.~

@604301 = ~Phantom Bow~

@604302 = ~This magical bow was created from a formula written by Salyvia the Gentle. It draws upon residual ambient magic to create its own arrows.

STATISTICS:

THAC0: +3
Damage: 1d6+3 piercing + 3 magical damage
Special: Sets the wielder's Shortbow proficiency to 1
Weight: 1
Speed Factor: 3
Proficiency Type: Shortbow
Type: Two-handed weapon~

@60431 = ~Torolonor's Deadly Remembrance~

@60432 = ~Torolonor's Deadly Remembrance (Alteration)

Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the mage exhausts their mental and physical barriers to recall spells already cast. This effort costs 60 hit points and allows the mage to recall three 5th-level spells.~

@60433 = ~Frenzied Skeleton~

@60434 = ~Frenzied Skeleton (Necromancy)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 9 rounds
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One skeleton
Saving Throw: None

This spell can affect only skeletons and has no effect upon any other non-skeletal creature.

The affected skeleton is driven into a frenzy. It gains the effects of Haste and attacks 3 times per round. On the 4th round, it gains an additional +3 Movement Rate and attacks 4 times per round. On the 7th round, it gains another +3 Movement Rate and attacks 5 times per round. On the 10th round, the strain becomes too great and the skeleton explodes in a shower of bone shards, inflicting 10d4 points of piercing damage upon all creatures in a small area around it. A successful save vs. breath weapon reduces this damage by half.~

@60435 = ~Electroneutralization~

@60436 = ~Electroneutralization (Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

All enemies within the affected area have any resistance to electricity negated, even if it is granted by magical items. Those who fail a save vs. spell at a -2 penalty instead have their electrical resistance set to -50%.~

@604361 = ~Electrical resistance negated~

@604362 = ~Electrical resistance set to -50%~

@60437 = ~Static Discharge~

@60438 = ~Static Discharge (Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: One creature, Special
Saving Throw: Special

This spell causes the static electricity surrounding the target to resonate violently. If the target fails a save vs. spell, it is struck by three successive electrical explosions, each inflicting 8D6 points of electrical damage and potentially affecting creatures within a 2-meter radius.

Creatures caught in these explosions, but not the original target, may halve the damage from each explosion with a successful save vs. spell. The first explosion imposes a -2 penalty on this saving throw, while the second imposes a -1 penalty.

If the target succeeds on its saving throw, it suffers only 10D6 points of electrical damage, with no explosions.~

@604389 = ~Static Discharge (Evocation)

Level: 5
Sphere: Elemental (Air)
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: One creature, Special
Saving Throw: Special

This spell causes the static electricity surrounding the target to resonate violently. If the target fails a save vs. spell, it is struck by three successive electrical explosions, each inflicting 8D6 points of electrical damage and potentially affecting creatures within a 2-meter radius.

Creatures caught in these explosions, but not the original target, may halve the damage from each explosion with a successful save vs. spell. The first explosion imposes a -2 penalty on this saving throw, while the second imposes a -1 penalty.

If the target succeeds on its saving throw, it suffers only 10D6 points of electrical damage, with no explosions.~

@6051 = ~Explosive Missiles~

@6052 = ~Explosive Missiles (Enchantment)

Level: 5
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell charges the target's missile weapon with elemental energy. Projectiles fired from the enchanted weapon explode upon impact, inflicting an additional 2d4 points of fire damage upon the target and all creatures within a 5-foot radius.

Each affected creature may make a save vs. spell to reduce this additional damage by half.~

@6053 = ~Mnemonic Corruption~

@6054 = ~Mnemonic Corruption (Enchantment)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: One arcane spellcaster
Saving Throw: Special

This spell affects wizards only and has no effect upon any other creature. If the targeted wizard fails a save vs. spell, 1d4 of his highest-level spells currently memorized become corrupted. He forgets each corrupted spell and suffers 4 points of damage for every spell lost.

This damage cannot kill the victim. If the damage would reduce the victim below 1 hit point, the victim instead falls unconscious, remaining at 1 hit point.

The saving throw penalty depends on the number of spells to be corrupted: -1 if 1 spell is affected, up to -4 if 4 spells are affected.~

@605419 = ~One Spell Corrupted~

@605429 = ~Two Spells Corrupted~

@605439 = ~Three Spells Corrupted~

@605449 = ~Four Spells Corrupted~

@6055 = ~Dancing Blades~

@6056 = ~Dancing Blades (Conjuration)

Level: 5
Range: The caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates one blade of pure magical energy for every 2 caster levels, each completely under the wizard's control. Every blade attacks using the caster's THAC0 with a +2 bonus, counts as a +2 magical weapon, and inflicts 2d4+2 points of magical damage.

Any creature struck by a dancing blade may make a save vs. spell to reduce the damage by half.~

@60561 = ~Dancing Blade~

@6057 = ~Arcane Cannon~

@6058 = ~Arcane Cannon (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transforms the wizard's forearm into an arcane cannon, its muzzle opening in the palm of the caster's hand. The wizard may still cast spells, but cannot wield another weapon without obstructing the cannon.

The cannon may fire one orb of chaotic energy per round at 9th level, two per round at 14th level, and three per round at 21st level. Each sphere counts as a +3 magical weapon and inflicts 1d6+3 points of magical damage.

Each shot also has a 20% chance of producing one additional effect:

1d8 fire damage
1d8 cold damage
1d8 electrical damage
1d8 acid damage
1d12 magical damage
2d6 bludgeoning damage
Blindness for 5 rounds
Curse for 5 rounds (-2 penalty to saving throws; does not stack)
Save vs. spell or be Slowed for 5 rounds
Save vs. spell or be Confused for 5 rounds~

@60581 = ~This arcane cannon can fire one sphere of chaotic energy per round.~

@60582 = ~This arcane cannon can fire two spheres of chaotic energy per round.~

@60583 = ~This arcane cannon can fire three spheres of chaotic energy per round.~

@6059 = ~Power Word: Resonance~

@60510 = ~Power Word: Resonance (Conjuration)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This Power Word creates deadly vibrations within the body of the chosen victim.

On the first round, the target suffers 2d8 points of damage and is stunned for 1 round.
On the second round, the target suffers 4d8 points of damage and is stunned for 1d4 rounds.
On the third round, the target suffers 8d8 points of damage and must make a save vs. death at a -2 penalty or explode.

Each round, the target may make a save vs. spell. A successful save halves the damage suffered that round and negates the secondary effect.~

@60511 = ~Mazaron's Fabulous Fireball~

@60512 = ~Mazaron's Fabulous Fireball (Evocation)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell reproduces the effects of a normal Fireball (10d6 points of fire damage; save vs. spell at a -2 penalty for half damage), but may be altered at will. During casting, the wizard chooses one of the following modifications:

Ethereal: The blast radius is increased by 50%, and the fireball passes through solid matter.

Focused: Inflicts 50% more damage.

Selective: Ignores designated creatures, typically allies.

Arcane: 50% of its fire damage is converted into magical damage.

Instant: Cast with a snap of the fingers, it detonates instantly at the chosen point without a projectile and imposes an additional -3 penalty to the saving throw.

Resonant: Inflicts only 2d6 damage, but detonates again around every creature struck. The number of secondary explosions around each target equals the total number of creatures hit by the original blast.

Unerring: Ignores both Magic Resistance and magical protective effects.

Animated: Inflicts only 4d6 damage, but summons four 2 Hit Dice Fire Elementals at the point of impact, which attack any nearby creature.

Delayed: Does not explode immediately upon reaching its destination, but remains in place until a creature comes within 10 feet.

Repeating: Inflicts only 6d6 damage, but detonates twice more at the same location: once 1 round later and again 2 rounds after the initial explosion.~

@605121 = ~Selective~

@605122 = ~Focused~

@605123 = ~Ethereal~

@605124 = ~Instant~

@605125 = ~Resonant~

@605126 = ~Animated~

@605127 = ~Arcane~

