@60513 = ~Precognition~

@60514 = ~Precognition (Divination)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to glimpse the immediate future. Forewarned of what is to come, the caster reacts with uncanny speed and subtly alters fate in his favor.

The caster gains a +4 bonus to Armor Class and to saving throws vs. spell, wands, and breath weapon attacks, and becomes immune to backstab attacks.~

@60515 = ~Balishen's Curse~

@60516 = ~Balishen's Curse (Enchantment)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/2 levels
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

If the targeted creature fails a save vs. spell at a -2 penalty, it is afflicted by a special curse. For the duration of the spell, whenever the victim is damaged by an attack, spell, or weapon, it suffers an additional 1d4 points of magical damage.~

@60517 = ~Ghostly Wail~

@60518 = ~Ghostly Wail (Necromancy)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Neg.

Upon casting this spell, the bard unleashes a dreadful wail like that of a restless ghost.

All creatures that hear the cry suffer a -2 penalty to attack rolls and saving throws for 1 turn, then must make a save vs. spell. Those who fail suffer one of the following effects:

50% chance of being deafened for 5 rounds
25% chance of being paralyzed for 5 rounds
25% chance of being both deafened and paralyzed for 5 rounds

Creatures deafened by this spell become immune to other sound-based spells (this spell, Resonant Note, Power Word: Resonance, and Banshee's Wail) for 5 rounds.~

@60519 = ~Spell Assurance~

@60520 = ~Spell Assurance (Abjuration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the caster with a dweomeric aura that ensures spells can be cast without hindrance and prevents them from being dispelled.

While protected by this aura, the caster is immune to Dispel Magic, Spell Failure, Forced Entropic Magic (though it does not prevent Wild Surges for Wild Mages), Silence, and Deafness. In addition, the caster is unaffected by Dead Magic or Wild Magic zones.~

@60521 = ~Caustic Breath~

@60522 = ~Caustic Breath (Evocation)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to exhale a stream of acid once per round. Each breath takes but a second to unleash, does not harm the caster, and inflicts 1d6 points of acid damage per 2 caster levels (to a maximum of 10d6). Creatures caught within the 80-degree, 13-foot cone in front of the caster may make a save vs. breath weapon for half damage.~

@60523 = ~Lubath's Accelerator~

@60524 = ~Lubath's Accelerator (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell accelerates the subject, granting an additional attack per round, +3 movement rate, +2 initiative, and +1 Armor Class.

The spell bends reality itself to hasten the subject. Such power comes at a cost: the strain inflicted upon the subject's body causes it to lose 1 hit point each round.

Lubath's Accelerator does not prevent the subject from benefiting from other sources of Haste. Because it slightly distorts reality around the subject, this spatial distortion grants an additional +1 bonus to Armor Class, while still allowing the subject to benefit from Blur and similar effects.

Every 6 caster levels, the wizard may increase the acceleration multiplier by one, up to a maximum of ×4. For each multiplier, all bonuses and penalties granted by the spell are multiplied. For example, at ×4, the subject gains +4 attacks per round, +12 movement rate, +8 initiative, +4 Armor Class (plus the additional +1 from spatial distortion), and loses 4 hit points each round.~

@605241 = ~Acceleration ×1~

@605242 = ~Acceleration ×2~

@605243 = ~Acceleration ×3~

@605244 = ~Acceleration ×4~

@60525 = ~Life Drain~

@60526 = ~Life Drain (Necromancy)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 9-ft. radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell creates a zone of necromantic energy that drains the life force of creatures within it. All creatures in the zone take 6D10 points of magical damage, halved if they succeed on a spell saving throw. For each creature affected by the spell (whether it passed the saving throw or not), the spellcaster gains 6 hit points, which are added to their maximum hit points and last for four turns.~

@60527 = ~Dweomeric Chant~

@60528 = ~Dweomeric Chant (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 24 hours
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transforms the bard's song into dweomeric harmonies that can be shaped into spells the bard already knows.

While the spell is in effect, the bard can no longer perform a normal bard song, but instead gains the ability to cast three additional spells. The spell level depends on the bard's level:

Level 13–15: three 3rd-level spells
Level 16–18: three 4th-level spells
Level 19–21: three 5th-level spells
Level 22+: three 6th-level spells~

@60529 = ~Mazaron's Fantastic Triad~

@60530 = ~Mazaron's Fantastic Triad (Conjuration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to cast three 3rd-level spells without expending any memorized spells, whether or not those spells are already known.

After casting this spell, the wizard gains a special ability allowing him to select any existing 3rd-level arcane spell. Once chosen, the spell may be cast freely without being deducted from the caster's memorized spells.

The ability may be used three times before it vanishes, or it expires after 1 turn if any uses remain.~

@605301 = ~3rd-Level Spell~

@60531 = ~Deflection Shields~

@60532 = ~Deflection Shields (Abjuration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 10-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell creates shields of magical energy around the caster that deflect incoming attacks.

Each round, every enemy within 10 feet of the caster must make a save vs. spell at a -2 penalty. Those who fail have their THAC0 set to 20 for that round. (This does not negate attack bonuses granted by magical weapons or special abilities.)~

@60533 = ~Lobini's Chaotic Protector*~

@60534 = ~Lobini's Chaotic Protector* (Abjuration, Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds/level - 4 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Created by the eccentric wizard Lobini the Magnificent, this spell protects the caster by granting a random defensive spell every 2 rounds. The granted spell may be of any spell level, but each lasts only 4 rounds.

Because new protections are granted before older ones expire, two defensive spells may overlap and combine—or not, should chance grant the same protection twice.

Lobini's Chaotic Protector may reproduce any of the following spells:

Protection from Evil, Armor, Ghost Armor, Spirit Armor, Shield, Spell Shield, Resist Fear, Blur, Mirror Image, Greater Mirror Image, Improved Invisibility, Mislead, Stoneskin, Minor Globe of Invulnerability, Globe of Invulnerability, Faerie Globe of Invulnerability, Antimagic Shell, Faerie Shield, Sovereign Body, Chaos Shield*, Improved Chaos Shield*, Fire Shield (Blue), Fire Shield (Red), Protection from Fire, Protection from Cold, Protection from Electricity, Protection from Acid, Protection from Magical Energy, Protection from the Elements, Protection from Energy, Keleg-Ze's Lightning Sphere, Deflection Shields, Protection from Normal Missiles, Protection from Normal Weapons, Protection from Magical Weapons, Mantle, Improved Mantle, Absolute Immunity, Invulnerability, Shock Shield, Spell Shield, Minor Spell Deflection, Spell Deflection, Spell Trap, Anti-Magic Sphere, Minor Spell Turning, Spell Turning, Precognition, Spell Assurance, and Troll Resistance.~

@60535 = ~Deorie's Magical Travels~

@60536 = ~Deorie's Magical Travels (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: Special
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Party
Saving Throw: None

Another creation of the half-fey Deorie, designed to help her companions escape dangerous situations, this spell grants the caster the ability to teleport the entire party with the snap of a finger. Once per round, at will and for the entire duration of the spell, the caster can choose any point on the map, even if it is not currently visible; the location only needs to be known. The entire party is then instantly transported to that location.~

@605369 = ~Deorie's Magical Escape (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: Special
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Party
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the caster the ability to teleport the entire party with the snap of a finger. Once per round, at will and for the entire duration of the spell, the caster can choose any point on the map, even if it is not currently visible; the location only needs to be known. The entire party is then instantly transported to that location.~

@60537 = ~Air Animation~

@60538 = ~Air Animation (Alteration)

Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the caster to awaken rudimentary consciousness within portions of the surrounding air, creating small air elementals under his control. He may create one elemental each round for the spell's duration. Each elemental remains animated for 1 turn before reverting to ordinary air.

The animated elementals have 2 Hit Dice, 10% Magic Resistance, and one attack per round dealing 1D10 bludgeoning damage with a +2 magical weapon. They are immune to non-magical weapons and to all spells from the Enchantment/Charm school.~

@60539 = ~Weapon Vulnerability~

@60540 = ~Weapon Vulnerability (Abjuration)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

If the target fails a save vs. spell at a -4 penalty, any immunity it possesses to normal or magical weapons is stripped away. Thereafter, the creature may be harmed by weapons of any kind.~

@605409 = ~Vulnerable to all weapons~

@60541 = ~Piboloo's Antimagic Sphere~

@60542 = ~Piboloo's Antimagic Sphere (Abjuration)

Level: 5
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a sphere around the caster whose purpose is to negate spells of one predetermined spell level. After casting the spell, the mage must choose a spell level from 1 to 6. The sphere then protects the caster against all spells of the chosen level.~

@805424 = ~4th-level spells~

@805425 = ~5th-level spells~

@805426 = ~6th-level spells~

@60543 = ~Entropic Unleashing*~

@60544 = ~Entropic Unleashing (Alteration)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds + 1 round per 10 levels
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When casting this spell, the wizard gains Improved Alacrity and a bonus of 4 to casting speed. However, each spell they cast triggers an entropic surge.~

@6061 = ~Telluric Protection~

@6062 = ~Telluric Protection (Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

While under the effects of this spell, the caster gains the favor of the earth so long as he remains in communion with it, meaning that both feet must remain firmly planted on the ground. As long as this condition is met, the caster is protected by Stoneskin each round. If he moves or is moved, the protection immediately ends.~

@6062999 = ~Telluric Protection ends.~

@6063 = ~Alabastine's Magical Conversion~

@6064 = ~Alabastine's Magical Conversion (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the wizard with an aura of diffuse magic that can be used to endlessly replenish his weaker spells. For the duration of the spell, the caster regains one memorized 1st- or 2nd-level spell each round, alternating between the two spell levels every 3 seconds.~

@6065 = ~Battle Fury~

@6066 = ~Battle Fury (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Casting Time: 6
Saving Throw: None

Originally created for the Red Guard of Alfheim's High Grove (and later spread by smugglers), this spell elevates the affected allies beyond their normal limits, improving every aspect of their combat abilities. They gain one additional attack per round, +2 to all physical attributes, initiative, Armor Class, attack rolls, and damage rolls, as well as +1 to all saving throws.

This spell cannot be combined with other effects that accelerate the targets (such as Haste).~

@60661 = ~Already under the effects of Battle Fury~

@60669 = ~Battle Fury (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Casting Time: 6
Saving Throw: None

This spell elevates the affected allies beyond their normal limits, improving every aspect of their combat abilities. They gain one additional attack per round, +2 to all physical attributes, initiative, Armor Class, attack rolls, and damage rolls, as well as +1 to all saving throws.

This spell cannot be combined with other effects that accelerate the targets (such as Haste).~

@606699 = ~Battle Fury (Alteration)

Level: 7
Sphere: Combat
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Casting Time: 6
Saving Throw: None

This spell elevates the affected allies beyond their normal limits, improving every aspect of their combat abilities. They gain one additional attack per round, +2 to all physical attributes, initiative, Armor Class, attack rolls, and damage rolls, as well as +1 to all saving throws.

This spell cannot be combined with other effects that accelerate the targets (such as Haste).~

@6067 = ~Door to the Interplan~

@6068 = ~Door to the Interplan (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: The caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Created especially by Agenor Parcilofann for his loyal customers, this spell transports the caster and any companions of their choice, up to 2 creatures per caster level, to the shop known as "The Interplan."

Once there, the caster can return to the exact location where the spell was cast simply by using the shop's exit door. The shop cannot be left by any normal means while using this spell, as the magically altered doorway is attuned to the caster's unique magical signature.

Special: This spell does not function in the Pocket Plane.~

@6069 = ~Scion of Flame~

@60610 = ~Scion of Flame (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell places the wizard in a state of communion with fire. While under its effects, the caster's fire resistance becomes 125% (causing fire damage to restore a small amount of hit points), and all fire damage inflicted by the caster is increased by 30%.~

@60611 = ~Boiling Blood~

@60612 = ~Boiling Blood (Necromancy)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell transforms the target creature's blood into burning acid. Each round, the victim suffers 1 point of fire damage and must make a save vs. spell. If the save fails, it suffers an additional 1d6 points of fire damage and 1d6 points of acid damage, while the agonizing shock imposes a -4 penalty to attack rolls and -2 Dexterity for that round.

This spell has no effect on creatures without blood, such as golems, undead, or elementals, and cannot be applied more than once to the same target.~

@60613 = ~Déorie's Memorization~

@60614 = ~Déorie's Memorization (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 24 hours
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

While under the effects of this spell, the wizard can memorize one fewer spell at the highest spell level he can cast, but one additional spell at every lower spell level.

This spell cannot be stacked with itself or with Déorie's Greater Memorization.~

@60615 = ~Keleg-Ze's Rending Chaos~

@60616 = ~Keleg-Ze's Rending Chaos (Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell imbues the weapon wielded by the wizard with magical energy drawn from the very essence of Chaos. The affected weapon deals an additional 1d20 points of magical damage. If the caster is wielding a missile weapon, the effect is applied to its ammunition instead. Against lawful creatures, the weapon deals an additional 1d20 points of magical damage.

However, Chaos despises stability. With each hit, there is a 5% chance that the weapon deals no additional damage, a 5% chance that it deals double the additional damage, and a 5% chance that the extra damage is inflicted upon the wizard as well.~

@60617 = ~Chromatic Missile Volley~

@60618 = ~Chromatic Missile Volley (Conjuration)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

This spell hurls a volley of magical missiles at the designated target, one missile for every two levels of the wizard. Each missile randomly reproduces one of the effects of a Chromatic Orb.

Each missile has:

* 20% chance to deal 1d4 points of magical damage and blind the target for 1 round
* 17% chance to deal 1d4 points of magical damage and cause the target to suffer for 1 round, imposing a -1 penalty to Strength, Dexterity, Armor Class, and THAC0
* 15% chance to deal 1d6 points of magical damage and blind the target for 1 turn
* 13% chance to deal 1d6 points of magical damage and burn the target, inflicting an additional 1d8 points of fire damage
* 11% chance to deal 1d8 points of magical damage and stun the target for 3 rounds
* 9% chance to deal 1d8 points of magical damage and weaken the target for 1 turn, imposing a -4 penalty to THAC0
* 7% chance to deal 1d10 points of magical damage and paralyze the target for 2 turns
* 5% chance to deal 1d12 points of acid damage and petrify the target
* 3% chance to deal 2d8 points of acid damage and slay the target

All secondary effects may be negated by a successful save vs. spell with a +4 bonus. A Shield spell or any similar effect blocks all missiles created by this spell.~

@60619 = ~Sovereign Body~

@60620 = ~Sovereign Body (Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the wizard saturates his body with the power of abjuration, making him extraordinarily difficult to kill.

The caster gains 50% resistance to physical, elemental, and magical damage, as well as 50% bonus hit points. He becomes immune to poison, disease, level drain, ability score penalties (any lost levels or ability points are immediately restored), polymorph, blindness, deafness, silence (existing effects are removed), paralysis, petrification, and non-magical weapons. In addition, he gains a +8 bonus to saving throws vs. death and polymorph, and regenerates 2 hit points per round.

However, the immense power of this spell comes at a severe cost. The wizard's body becomes so thoroughly saturated with magic that it disrupts any further spellcasting. For the duration of the spell, the caster is unable to cast any other spells.~

@60621 = ~Frostbite~

@60622 = ~Frostbite (Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Instantaneous, Special
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

An icy chill descends upon the targeted area. Creatures caught within it experience a sudden and dramatic drop in body temperature, suffering hypothermia as though they had been exposed to extreme polar cold for an extended period.

Affected creatures suffer 1d4 points of cold damage per caster level (maximum 20d4; save vs. spell for half). Those who also fail a save vs. death suffer an additional 1d3 points of exhaustion damage per two caster levels (maximum 10d3). This exhaustion damage cannot kill its victims, but increases their Fatigue by 1 point per die of exhaustion damage inflicted, up to a maximum of +10 Fatigue).~

@6062299 = ~Frostbite (Evocation)

Level: 7
Sphere: Combat
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Instantaneous, Special
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

An icy chill descends upon the targeted area. Creatures caught within it experience a sudden and dramatic drop in body temperature, suffering hypothermia as though they had been exposed to extreme polar cold for an extended period.

Affected creatures suffer 1d4 points of cold damage per caster level (maximum 20d4; save vs. spell for half). Those who also fail a save vs. death suffer an additional 1d3 points of exhaustion damage per two caster levels (maximum 10d3). This exhaustion damage cannot kill its victims, but increases their Fatigue by 1 point per die of exhaustion damage inflicted, up to a maximum of +10 Fatigue).~

@60623 = ~Impact Ward~

@60624 = ~Impact Ward (Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the caster with a soft, flexible barrier of magical energy that conforms perfectly to the wizard's movements without hindering them. Despite its pliable nature, the barrier is remarkably resistant to compression, protecting the caster from violent impacts.

The wizard gains 100% resistance to crushing damage, falling damage, and knockback effects.~

@60627 = ~Unspeakable Beauty~

@60628 = ~Unspeakable Beauty (Illusion, Enchantment)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transforms the caster into the very embodiment of beauty, capable of captivating any Medium-sized biped to whom attention is directed. The caster's Charisma becomes 23 and, for the duration of the spell, the caster may use *Charm Person* at will as a special ability (save vs. spell at -2; the target does not become hostile when the effect ends).~

@60629 = ~Tokilom's Magic Slippers~

@60630 = ~Tokilom's Magic Slippers (Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell, created by Tokilom of Selgaunt so he could sell his creation indefinitely, earned him not only imprisonment but also the loss of his ability to create other magical items. No matter—these slippers are now forever available to anyone who has access to this spell.

The spell creates Tokilom's Magic Slippers in the caster's inventory. They double the wearer's movement rate, grant the effects of *Free Action*, and make their wearer more attractive. They can be worn by anyone.~

@606309 = ~Tokilom's Magic Slippers (Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates Tokilom's Magic Slippers in the caster's inventory. They double the wearer's movement rate, grant the effects of *Free Action*, and make their wearer more attractive. They can be worn by anyone.~

@606301 = ~These tasteful magical slippers are a creation of Tokilom, a talented mage who wasn't particularly bright.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:

* Doubles movement speed.
* Free Action (does not grant immunity to Haste).
* Charisma: +1.~

@60631 = ~Familiar Metamorphosis~

@60632 = ~Familiar Metamorphosis (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: the caster's familiar
Saving Throw: none

This spell transforms the caster's familiar into a Gauth. Although this improves its combat abilities, it does not increase its hit points or make it any more aggressive, so the mage must still guide it carefully. And it would be wise to remain cautious.~

@60633 = ~Stone to Gem~

@60634 = ~Stone to Gem (Alteration)

Level: 6
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: One stone
Saving Throw: None

This spell subjects a stone held by the caster to the effects of time and physical conditions that might naturally transform it into a gem. There is a 2% chance per caster level that the stone becomes a gem, up to a maximum chance of 40%.~

@606369 = ~The stone remains unchanged.~

@6063699 = ~The stone has become a gem!~

@60635 = ~Evisceration~

@60636 = ~Evisceration (Necromancy)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Neg.

If the target fails a save vs. spell at a -2 penalty, its blood and viscera are violently expelled from its body, tearing numerous gaping wounds as they burst forth. The victim suffers enough slashing damage to lose half its current hit points, rounded up, and is stunned by the trauma for 1 round.

Undead, elementals, and golems are unaffected by this spell.~

@60637 = ~Summon Permanence~

@60638 = ~Summon Permanence (Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: One summoned creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell affects only a summoned creature, regardless of its type. It has no effect on creatures that were not summoned, nor on illusory creatures.

The summoned creature targeted by this spell is no longer subject to the duration of the spell that summoned it and becomes permanent. It can also no longer be banished or destroyed by spells and effects that would normally end a summoning, such as Death Spell or Dismissal.

The creature remains bound to the area in which it was summoned.~

@6071 = ~Starblade~

@6072 = ~Starblade (Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

A beam of pure light springs from the mage's hand, taking on the rough shape of a blade. The caster can alter its length and form, choosing between a returning throwing dagger, a dagger, a shortsword, a longsword, or a bastard sword. Regardless of its form, the weapon counts as a +4 magical weapon and deals double the base damage of the chosen weapon (2D8+4 for a sword). It easily pierces even the toughest defenses, grants a +4 bonus to THAC0, and reduces the target's Magic Resistance by 5% for 1 turn each time it strikes.~

@6073 = ~Deorie's Anarchic Recall~

@6074 = ~Deorie's Anarchic Recall (Alteration)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to recover a spell previously cast. The level of the recovered spell is random and depends on the caster's level:

Level 14 to 16: one level 5 to 7 spell
Level 17 to 19: one level 5 to 8 spell
Level 20 to 22: one level 6 to 8 spell
Level 23 to 25: one level 6 to 9 spell
Level 26 to 28: one level 7 to 9 spell
Level 29 and above: one level 7 to 10 spell (double chance of recovering a level 9 spell).~

@60745 = ~One level 5 spell recovered~

@60746 = ~One level 6 spell recovered~

@60747 = ~One level 7 spell recovered~

@60748 = ~One level 8 spell recovered~

@60749 = ~One level 9 spell recovered~

@6075 = ~Affliction~

@6076 = ~Affliction (Necromancy)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 4-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell causes ashes gathered from tombs, battlefields, the lairs of savage beasts, and other tainted and unholy places to rain down upon the target area. Living creatures within the area suffer:

Contagion if they fail a save vs. death.

Blindness and Deafness (2 turns) if they fail a save vs. spell.

Hold Monster (1 turn) if they fail a save vs. polymorph.

Stun (5 rounds) if they fail a save vs. breath weapon.

This spell has no effect on constructs or undead.~

@607699 = ~Affliction (Necromancy)

Level: 6
Sphere: Evil
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 4-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell causes ashes gathered from tombs, battlefields, the lairs of savage beasts, and other tainted and unholy places to rain down upon the target area. Living creatures within the area suffer:

Contagion if they fail a save vs. death.

Blindness and Deafness (2 turns) if they fail a save vs. spell.

Hold Monster (1 turn) if they fail a save vs. polymorph.

Stun (5 rounds) if they fail a save vs. breath weapon.

This spell has no effect on constructs or undead.~

@6077 = ~Salyvia's Magical Arrow~

@6078 = ~Salyvia's Magical Arrow (Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a single, highly magical arrow in the caster's inventory. The arrow is a +4 magical weapon, granting +4 to THAC0 and dealing 1D6+4 piercing damage plus 4 points of magical damage. After every shot, the arrow is automatically recreated in the wielder's quiver. It can be used by any character capable of wielding a bow and lasts for one full day.~

@60781 = ~This returning magical arrow was created by the renowned conjurer Salyvia so that it could be summoned and used by anyone.

STATISTICS

THAC0: +4
Damage: 1D6+4, +4 magical damage
Damage Type: Missile (Piercing)
Weight: 0
Launcher: Bow~

@6079 = ~Greater Weapon Enchantment~

@60710 = ~Greater Weapon Enchantment (Enchantment)

Level: 7
Range: Touch
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: One touched melee weapon
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the touched melee weapon a unique magical ability of the caster's choice. The weapon gains no enchantment bonus and, if it was originally non-magical, it is still treated as a non-magical weapon. However, it gains one of the following on-hit effects, chosen by the caster:

- +1D10 magical damage
- Vampiric (drains 2 hit points)
- Doom (-2 to all rolls, non-stacking)
- Dispel Magic (100% chance)
- Undead Disruption (save vs. death at -4)
- Slow (3 rounds)
- Stun (save vs. spell, 2 rounds)
- Level Drain (save vs. death)
- Death (save vs. death at +4)~

@607101 = ~Magical Damage~

@607102 = ~Vampiric~

@607104 = ~Undead Disruption~

@607105 = ~Stun~

@607107 = ~Level Drain~

@60711 = ~Rainbow Projectile~

@60712 = ~Rainbow Projectile (Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 1 creature, special
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell hurls a sphere of combined, unstable elemental energies at the target. The sphere automatically hits, dealing 1D8 points of damage per caster level (maximum 20D8; save vs. spell for half damage), and has:

22% chance to deal fire damage
22% chance to deal cold damage
22% chance to deal electrical damage
22% chance to deal acid damage
12% chance to explode, dealing quadruple damage to the target and all creatures within a 1.5-meter radius, as all four elements combine.~

@60713 = ~Lobini's Urgent Summoning~

@60714 = ~Lobini's Urgent Summoning (Conjuration/Summoning)
Level: 7
Range: Sight range
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Another brilliant creation of Lobini the Magnificent, this spell summons 1d3 monsters with a single gesture to protect the caster. The drawback is that there is no way to know in advance which monsters will appear: the result is random.~

@60715 = ~Arachnid Web~

@60716 = ~Arachnid Web (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell is similar to the 2nd-level spell Web, but it is more difficult to escape from (saving throw at -4). In addition, every creature within the web's area of effect, whether or not it is immobilized by the web, has a 15% chance each round of causing 1D3 highly aggressive mutant spiders to appear.

Spiders created in this way are under the caster's control, attack the caster's enemies, and disappear after 3 rounds if they have not been killed.~

@607161 = ~Mutant Spider~

@607162 = ~Huge Spider~

@60717 = ~Ralorn's Dragon-Slaying Missile~

@60718 = ~Ralorn's Dragon-Slaying Missile (Evocation / Necromancy)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell launches a missile charged with energy specifically designed to slay dragons. Against dragons, the target's Magic Resistance is reduced by 30%. If a dragon is struck by the missile, it must succeed on a save vs. death or die instantly. Even if it survives, it still suffers 20D10 points of damage, which may be enough to kill it.

Against non-dragon creatures, the spell does not benefit from the Magic Resistance penalty, cannot kill the target outright, and instead deals only 20D6 points of damage, halved on a successful save vs. spell.~

@60719 = ~Ice Orb~

@60720 = ~Ice Orb (Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 3.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

The caster gathers intense cold between their hands, condenses it into an orb, and hurls it at the chosen location. Upon impact, the orb explodes, dealing 10D8 points of cold damage to all creatures within the area while encasing them in a layer of ice.

Affected creatures are slowed for 5 rounds and become immobilized for 1 turn if they fail a save vs. spell at -2. A successful saving throw prevents the immobilization, but neither the damage nor the slowing effect can be avoided.

Undead cannot be immobilized by this spell.~

@60723 = ~Illusory Ally~

@60724 = ~Illusory Ally (Illusion)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: One party member
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates an illusory duplicate of any party member. The duplicate possesses the same equipment as the original but only 60% of its combat abilities, hit points, and saving throws. It can move and attack, but cannot cast spells or use special abilities or quick-slot items. It remains in existence for the spell's duration or until destroyed.

There is no limit to the number of illusory allies that may be controlled at once, but each party member may have only one associated duplicate.~

@607241 = ~This ally already has an illusory duplicate~

@60725 = ~Create Spectral Mage~

@60726 = ~Create Spectral Mage (Necromancy)

Level: 7
Range: 10 meters
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round per caster level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a 10th-level spectral mage that uses all of its abilities, including its spells and paralyzing touch, to aid the mage who summoned it.~

@607261 = ~Spectral Mage~

@607262 = ~Spectral Pyromancer~

@60727 = ~Nature Communion~

@60728 = ~Nature Communion (Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: Variable
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

A more powerful version of *Contact with Nature*, this spell grants access to the following spells:

Level 14 to 17: Conjure Animals, Conjure Fire Elemental, Summon Wolves.
Level 18 to 21: Conjure Animal Spirit, Creeping Doom, Storm of Vengeance.
Level 22 and above: Elemental Summoning, Fire Elemental Transformation, Earth Elemental Transformation, Nature's Beauty.

Summon Wolves: This spell summons a number of different wolves whose total Hit Dice equal the caster's level plus 3 (23 Hit Dice at caster level 20).

Conjure Animal Spirit: This spell summons an animal spirit (bear, wolf, lion, or serpent) to aid the mage for 6 turns.~

@607281 = ~Summon Wolves~

@60729 = ~Hachitoza's Troop Enhancement~

@60730 = ~Hachitoza's Troop Enhancement (Divination, Enchantment)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

It was when Hachitoza was appointed general to defend Kara-Tur against yet another barbarian invasion that he improved the spell that had made him famous, adapting it to benefit large numbers of warriors.

All allies affected by this spell can perceive weaknesses in their enemies more easily. They gain a +3 bonus to THAC0 and a 15% increased chance to score a critical hit.~

@607309 = ~Hachitoza's Troop Enhancement (Divination, Enchantment)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

All allies affected by this spell can perceive weaknesses in their enemies more easily. They gain a +3 bonus to THAC0 and a 15% increased chance to score a critical hit.~

@60733 = ~Deorie's Greater Memorization~

@60734 = ~Deorie's Greater Memorization (Alteration)

Level: 7
Range: 0
Duration: 24 hours
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

While under the effects of this spell, the wizard can memorize two additional spells of the highest spell level available to him, but one fewer spell of every lower level.

This spell cannot be combined with itself or with Deorie's Memorization.~

@60735 = ~Tattoo of Power~

@60736 = ~Tattoo of Power (Alteration, Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: Touch
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell inscribes a special tattoo upon the skin of the touched creature, imbuing it with enough energy to cast three evocation spells before the tattoo disappears at the end of the spell's duration. The recipient of the tattoo may cast three spells, choosing each time from the following list:

* Agannazar's Scorcher (8D6 points of damage)
* Chain Lightning (8D6 points of damage)
* Lightning Bolt (10D6 points of damage)
* Fireball (10D6 points of damage)
* Cone of Cold (10D4+10 points of damage)
* Flame Arrow (12D6 points of damage)

All of these spells are treated as 6th-level spells, have a fixed casting time of 3 segments, and allow a save vs. spell for half damage, except Agannazar's Scorcher.

Multiple tattoos cannot be applied to the same creature: each new tattoo replaces the previous one.~

@6073699 = ~This tattoo allows the bearer to cast one spell of their choice from the following list:

* Agannazar's Scorcher (8D6 points of damage)
* Chain Lightning (8D6 points of damage)
* Lightning Bolt (10D6 points of damage)
* Fireball (10D6 points of damage)
* Cone of Cold (10D4+10 points of damage)
* Flame Arrow (12D6 points of damage)~

@60737 = ~Porphatys' Breath~

@60738 = ~Porphatys' Breath (Conjuration)

Level: 7
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 3.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell conjures a blast of freezing acid from another plane into the targeted area. All creatures within the area suffer 10D4 acid damage and 10D4 cold damage (save vs. breath weapon for half damage).

Those who fail their saving throw must also make a save vs. spell. Those who fail are encased in ice for 6 rounds. While in this state, they are frozen solid, unable to interact with the outside world but likewise unreachable by it.

Each round spent encased in ice, they suffer 1D4 cold damage, 1D4 acid damage, and 3D6 crushing/suffocation damage.~

@6081 = ~Sorcerous Eye~

@6082 = ~Sorcerous Eye (Alteration)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell is similar to the 4th-level *Wizard Eye*, which creates an invisible eye capable of scouting areas for the caster. However, this version creates a more powerful eye, capable of using magical powers.

The eye can instantly cast each of the following spells twice:

* Hold Monster (single target)
* Chaos (single target)
* Feeblemind
* Domination
* Mnemonic Corruption.~

@6083 = ~Trollslayer Cloud~

@6084 = ~Trollslayer Cloud (Conjuration/Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

Created specifically during the troll invasion of Arborea, this spell conjures a small cloud laden with acid that pours its contents over the chosen target.

The victim suffers 2D4 acid damage per caster level, halved on a successful save vs. spell.

If the victim fails its saving throw, the acid ignites a few moments later. The victim suffers an additional 1D4 acid damage per caster level and must make a save vs. death. If the save is failed, the victim is dissolved.~

@60849 = ~Trollslayer Cloud (Conjuration/Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell conjures a small cloud laden with acid that pours its contents over the chosen target.

The victim suffers 2D4 acid damage per caster level, halved on a successful save vs. spell.

If the victim fails its saving throw, the acid ignites a few moments later. The victim suffers an additional 1D4 acid damage per caster level and must make a save vs. death. If the save is failed, the victim is dissolved.~

@608499 = ~Trollslayer Cloud (Conjuration/Evocation)

Level: Quest
Sphere: Elemental (Acid)
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell conjures a small cloud laden with acid that pours its contents over the chosen target.

The victim suffers 2D4 acid damage per caster level, halved on a successful save vs. spell.

If the victim fails its saving throw, the acid ignites a few moments later. The victim suffers an additional 1D4 acid damage per caster level and must make a save vs. death. If the save is failed, the victim is dissolved.~

@6085 = ~March of the Dead~

@6086 = ~March of the Dead (Necromancy)

Level: 8
Range: 10 meters
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell searches an enormous area for intact corpses that have not been properly sanctified through burial rites. They are gathered at the location chosen by the caster and raised as undead.

When the spell is cast, 3D10 corpses are summoned and may become:

* Skeletons (40%)
* Zombies (32%)
* Skeleton Archers (12%)
* Skeleton Mages (8%)
* Skeleton Warriors (4%)
* Ghouls (2%)
* Ghasts (2%).~

@6089 = ~Assassin's Strike~

@60810 = ~Assassin's Strike (Alteration)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of caster
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: None

This spell temporarily grants the wizard the abilities of an assassin, allowing him to strike his target with ruthless efficiency.

Once the target is designated and the spell is cast, the wizard is teleported directly beside the target, gains a +7 bonus to melee THAC0, and all of his attacks are treated as backstabs with a ×4 backstab multiplier.

At wizard level 30, these bonuses increase to +10 melee THAC0 and a ×5 backstab multiplier.

Note: Although the spell teleports the wizard beside the designated target, he is not required to attack it. The bonuses granted by the spell apply to any creature he attacks for the duration of the spell.~

@60811 = ~Lightning Arm~

@60812 = ~Lightning Arm (Invocation)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the caster's arm becomes charged with electricity, granting several benefits:

* The caster gains 25% resistance to electricity.
* The electricity extends to any weapon he wields, causing all of his melee attacks to inflict an additional 2D4 points of electrical damage.
* Once per round, he can unleash a Lightning Bolt that deals 4D6 points of damage (save vs. spell for half). The bolt ricochets whenever it strikes a wall or any other solid surface.
* The caster can discharge all of the electricity in a Chain Lightning that deals 12D6 points of damage (save vs. spell for half). Doing so immediately ends the spell.~

@60813 = ~Explosive Teleportation~

@60814 = ~Explosive Teleportation (Alteration, Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: Special

This spell allows the mage to teleport up to five times during the spell's duration. Each teleport takes only one second (the time required to designate the destination) and creates a small explosion with a 3.5-meter radius at the arrival point, dealing 10D6 points of fire damage (save vs. spell for half damage).~

@608141 = ~Explosive Teleport~

@60815 = ~Korrelo's Discreet Executioner~

@60816 = ~Korrelo's Discreet Executioner (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons the creation of the mage Korrelo: an 8 Hit Dice magical executioner golem. The golem is invisible and immune to normal and +1 weapons, as well as spells of levels 1 to 3. It has 35% resistance to all damage and 35% Magic Resistance, and attacks three times per round with magical projectiles.~

@60817 = ~Mass Rage~

@60818 = ~Mass Rage (Enchantment)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

This spell causes all allies within the targeted area to enter a barbarian-like rage. They gain +4 Strength, +4 Constitution, and +2 to saving throws vs. spells, but suffer a -2 penalty to Armor Class. They also become immune to charm, hold, fear, maze, stun, sleep, confusion, and level drain effects.~

@6081899 = ~Mass Rage (Enchantment)

Level: Quest
Sphere: Mental
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 15 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

This spell causes all allies within the targeted area to enter a barbarian-like rage. They gain +4 Strength, +4 Constitution, and +2 to saving throws vs. spells, but suffer a -2 penalty to Armor Class. They also become immune to charm, hold, fear, maze, stun, sleep, confusion, and level drain effects.~

@60819 = ~Resonant Spontaneous Combustion~

@60820 = ~Resonant Spontaneous Combustion (Evocation, Necromancy)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Negates

The original scroll of this spell was recovered from the Plains of Carnage in Ysgard by the band of mercenaries who survived their dreadful battle against Kra'lo-benn, the fenser necromancer. It was kept in the library of Skeinheim's Circular Hall before disappearing one evening after excessive revelry. Since then, a few copies of the scroll have appeared for sale in the markets of Glorium.

The targeted creature experiences a catastrophic rise in internal temperature. It suffers 5D6 fire damage and must make a save vs. spells at -2. If it fails, it is completely incinerated, creating a fireball with a 4-meter radius that reproduces the same effect: every creature caught in the explosion suffers 5D6 fire damage and must make a save vs. spells at -2 or explode into another fireball that reproduces the same effects.

The spell can therefore spread indefinitely, with its area of effect traveling far beyond the original point of impact. It continues as long as new explosions are generated.

However, each creature can normally be affected only once. Any creature caught in a fireball that succeeds on its saving throw is automatically protected from the effects of the spell for the next two rounds. (If the chain reaction later returns to the same area, that creature may be affected again three rounds after its initial exposure.)

Creatures immune to fire cannot be affected by this spell.~

@608209 = ~Resonant Spontaneous Combustion (Evocation, Necromancy)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Negates

The targeted creature experiences a catastrophic rise in internal temperature. It suffers 5D6 fire damage and must make a save vs. spells at -2. If it fails, it is completely incinerated, creating a fireball with a 4-meter radius that reproduces the same effect: every creature caught in the explosion suffers 5D6 fire damage and must make a save vs. spells at -2 or explode into another fireball that reproduces the same effects.

The spell can therefore spread indefinitely, with its area of effect traveling far beyond the original point of impact. It continues as long as new explosions are generated.

However, each creature can normally be affected only once. Any creature caught in a fireball that succeeds on its saving throw is automatically protected from the effects of the spell for the next two rounds. (If the chain reaction later returns to the same area, that creature may be affected again three rounds after its initial exposure.)

Creatures immune to fire cannot be affected by this spell.~

@60821 = ~Call of Fire~

@60822 = ~Call of Fire (Summoning)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell allows the caster to open a portal to the Elemental Plane of Fire, drawing forth primordial flame and perhaps a few of its native inhabitants. While maintaining the call, the caster cannot move without breaking the connection.

As the fire emerges, it erupts in a burst of flames lasting three seconds. During the first second, it deals 12D10 fire damage to all creatures within 4.5 meters of the caster and has a 12% chance of summoning a fire creature. During the second second, it deals 8D10 fire damage and has an 8% chance of summoning a fire creature. During the third second, it deals 4D10 fire damage and has a 4% chance of summoning a fire creature. A successful saving throw vs. spells halves all damage.

The call lasts five seconds, but if any creatures appear, they are treated as summoned creatures. The caster retains control of them for two turns before they return to their home plane.~

@608221 = ~Venerable Fire Elemental~

@6082299 = ~Call of Fire (Summoning)

Level: 7
Sphere: Elemental (Fire)
Range: 0
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell allows the caster to open a portal to the Elemental Plane of Fire, drawing forth primordial flame and perhaps a few of its native inhabitants. While maintaining the call, the caster cannot move without breaking the connection.

As the fire emerges, it erupts in a burst of flames lasting three seconds. During the first second, it deals 12D10 fire damage to all creatures within 4.5 meters of the caster and has a 12% chance of summoning a fire creature. During the second second, it deals 8D10 fire damage and has an 8% chance of summoning a fire creature. During the third second, it deals 4D10 fire damage and has a 4% chance of summoning a fire creature. A successful saving throw vs. spells halves all damage.

The call lasts five seconds, but if any creatures appear, they are treated as summoned creatures. The caster retains control of them for two turns before they return to their home plane.~

@60823 = ~Keleg-Ze's Vengeful Discharges~

@60824 = ~Keleg-Ze's Vengeful Discharges (Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: Special

This spell grants the mage a retaliatory ability: whenever they are struck by a weapon or spell, they unleash an electrical discharge centered on themselves. Every hostile creature within a 4.5-meter radius suffers 4d8 electrical damage and is stunned for 1d2 rounds. Creatures that succeed on a saving throw vs. spells take only half damage and avoid the stun.~

@60827 = ~Keleg-Ze's Lightning Sphere~

@60828 = ~Keleg-Ze's Lightning Sphere (Summoning)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 1.5-meter radius sphere
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the caster with a sphere of electricity, granting several benefits:

* Electrical resistance is set to 100%.
* All electrical damage is reflected back to its source.
* Whenever the mage is attacked by a creature within the sphere's radius, that creature suffers 3d6 electrical damage, must succeed on a saving throw vs. spells or be stunned for 2 rounds, and has a 10% chance of being struck by a chain lightning dealing 8d6 electrical damage (save vs. spells for half damage).~

@60829 = ~Mazaron's Formidable Tetrad~

@60830 = ~Mazaron's Formidable Tetrad (Alteration)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the mage to cast four 4th-level spells without expending memorized spell slots, whether or not they actually know those spells.

After casting this spell, the mage gains a special ability allowing them to choose any existing 4th-level spell. Once selected, that spell can be cast freely without consuming a memorized spell slot. The ability may be used four times before disappearing, or it expires automatically after two turns if not fully used.~

@608301 = ~4th-level spell~

@60831 = ~Magic Purge~

@60832 = ~Magic Purge (Abjuration)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 4 rounds
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

This spell dispels all magic from every creature within the target area with a 100% chance of success. Summoned creatures are banished, illusory images are dispelled, and clouds are blown away. No saving throw is allowed, and Magic Resistance is ignored.

In addition, the magical aura of every affected creature is severely disrupted, making spellcasting difficult for the next 4 rounds: 100% chance to fail to cast a spell during the first round, 75% during the second, 50% during the third, and 25% during the fourth.~

@60833 = ~Korrelo's Troubling Mist~

@60834 = ~Korrelo's Troubling Mist (Enchantment)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

When casting this spell, the mage must choose one of the available spells. The spell then creates a mist in which creatures are subjected each round to the effects of the chosen spell, after making a saving throw if the spell allows one (personal effect, fixed duration of 1 round, non-cumulative).

The mist can produce the effects of the following spells:
Hold Person, Dire Charm, Berserk, Confusion, Greater Malison, Emotion: Hopelessness, and Emotion: Fear.

Starting at caster level 28, the mist can also produce the effects of the following spells:
Ray of Enfeeblement, Slow, Polymorph Other, Phantasmal Killer, Moving Ground, Chaos, Feeblemind, Domination, and Hold Monster.~

@608341 = ~Emotion: Hopelessness~

@608342 = ~Emotion: Fear~

@60835 = ~Explosive Minion Creation~

@60836 = ~Explosive Minion Creation (Summoning)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a heavily enchanted 8 Hit Dice fire elemental from any existing flame.

The elemental can attack twice per round, generating an explosion that deals 4d6 fire damage to all creatures within 2.5 meters of it (save vs. spells for half damage).

It can also generate a greater explosion, which kills it, dealing 20d6 fire damage to all creatures within 4.5 meters (save vs. spells for half damage). This explosion occurs automatically if the elemental is slain.~

@608361 = ~Explosive Minion~

@608362 = ~Explosion~

@608363 = ~Greater Explosion~

@60837 = ~Nix's Explosive Critters~

@60838 = ~Nix's Explosive Critters (Conjuration/Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 5 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell summons 1D4+1 small, extremely fast creatures with a single purpose: to rush toward an enemy and explode in a fireball, dealing 10D6 fire damage (save vs. breath for half damage).

Each creature has only 11 hit points and also explodes if it takes any damage that does not kill it outright. However, it does not explode if it is killed by a single blow or in any other way that kills it outright.~

@608381 = ~Explosive Critter~

@60839 = ~Fire Form~

@60840 = ~Fire Form (Alteration)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When casting this spell, the caster's body gradually transforms into fire, while their equipment melts into the flames and takes on the final form of a fire elemental.

In this form, the caster becomes immune to all forms of fire damage, as well as poison, disease, non-magical weapons, and backstab attacks. Their natural Armor Class becomes -1, their Strength 19, and their Constitution 17. Their fists can be used twice per round with a +3 bonus to THAC0 and deal 1D8 bludgeoning damage plus 1D10 fire damage.

They burn through webs, Entangle, and grease, passing unhindered through all of them.

The caster retains the ability to cast spells and can use the following abilities granted by their new form at will:

Burning Hands (4D12, save vs. spells for half damage)
Agannazar's Scorcher (4D10, save vs. spells for half damage)
Flame Breath (4D8, save vs. breath for half damage)
Fireball (4D6, save vs. spells for half damage).~

@608401 = ~Flame Breath~

@60841 = ~Fantastic Convergence~

@60842 = ~Fantastic Convergence (Divination)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: 2 rounds
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the mage to glimpse all possible favorable outcomes in their immediate future and make the ultimate favorable outcome become reality.

For the next two rounds, all damage dealt by the caster is doubled, and they gain a +20 bonus to saving throws and attack rolls.~

@60843 = ~Suspended Time~

@60844 = ~Suspended Time (Alteration)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Negates

All enemies within the targeted area must make a save vs. spells at -2.

Those who fail are frozen in time: the world continues to move around them, but they remain suspended at that exact moment, unable to interact with their surroundings.

Those who succeed on the saving throw are merely slowed for 5 rounds.~

@60845 = ~Touch of the Abyss~

@60846 = ~Touch of the Abyss (Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell opens a portal to the Abyss from which a burst of elemental energy combining several Abyssal planes is expelled. All creatures within the area suffer 8D6 fire damage, 4D6 acid damage, and 4D6 cold damage, halved on a successful save vs. breath.

They must also make three additional saving throws:

- A save vs. spells or lose 2 levels.
- A save vs. poison or become poisoned, suffering 6 points of damage per round for 1 turn.
- A save vs. polymorph or become sickened, suffering -2 to Strength and Constitution, being slowed, and losing 1 hit point per round for 5 turns.

Each time this spell is cast, there is a 3% chance that a Tanar'ri in the Abyss notices the portal and decides to enter it. Should this happen, its sole purpose upon arriving on the Prime Material Plane is to wreak havoc.~

@608461 = ~Bodak~

@608462 = ~Balor~

@608463 = ~Nabassu~

@608464 = ~Marilith~

@6091 = ~Energy Assault~

@6092 = ~Energy Assault (Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: One creature
Saving Throw: Special

This spell unleashes a massive discharge of pure energy at a creature, surrounding it before collapsing inward upon itself. If the creature fails a saving throw vs. death at -4, it is utterly annihilated by the concentric energy nova, and only a Wish spell can restore it to life. If it succeeds, it still suffers 10D6 magical damage.

The power of this spell is so great that it can affect creatures normally immune to death effects and similar abilities.~

@6093 = ~Obliteration~

@6094 = ~Obliteration (Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 13.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

This spell is the mage's ultimate last resort when all other options have failed.

Upon casting it, the mage converts all of their life force into magical energy and releases it as a sphere of power that engulfs a vast area, ignoring all physical barriers (it even passes through walls). Every enemy within the area suffers 1D20 magical damage per caster level (maximum 30D20, save vs. spells at -2 for half damage).

Because the spell consumes the caster's entire life force, the mage dies if they fail a saving throw vs. death at +2. If the saving throw succeeds, they survive with 1 hit point remaining but fall unconscious for 2 rounds.

Note 1: When rolling damage, all results of 1 or 2 on the D20s are treated as 3.

Note 2: Since the mage sacrifices their own life force to fuel this spell, effects such as Protection from Death cannot prevent death caused by this self-sacrifice.~

@6095 = ~Blazing Sun~

@6096 = ~Blazing Sun (Illusion/Phantasm)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: 12-meter radius
Saving Throw: Negates

This spell creates the illusion of a blazing sun hanging above the affected area. All enemies who fail a saving throw vs. spells believe themselves to be consumed by its scorching heat and suffer 30D12 fire damage.~

@6097 = ~Dance of Steel~

@6098 = ~Dance of Steel (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: Sight of the caster
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: One target
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the target Improved Haste and allows them to make ten attacks per round.~

@6099 = ~Greater Arcane Cannon~

@60910 = ~Greater Arcane Cannon (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a magical cannon within the mage's forearm, with its muzzle opening in the palm of the caster's hand. The mage can still cast spells, but cannot wield another weapon without obstructing the cannon.

The cannon can fire four times per round, launching bolts of energy that deal 1D10+5 magical damage, grant a +3 bonus to THAC0, and count as +5 weapons.

Each energy bolt has a 30% chance of applying one additional effect chosen from the following:

* 1D12 fire damage
* 1D12 cold damage
* 1D12 electrical damage
* 1D12 acid damage
* 1D20 magical damage
* 2D10 crushing damage
* Blindness for 1 turn
* Dispel Magic
* Curse for 1 turn (-2 to saving throws, non-cumulative)
* Save vs. spells at -2 or Slow for 1 turn
* Save vs. spells at -2 or Confusion for 1 turn
* Save vs. polymorph or be transformed into a squirrel
* Save vs. spells or be stunned for 3 rounds
* Save vs. spells or be petrified
* Save vs. spells at +2 or be disintegrated~

@609101 = ~This magical cannon can fire four chaotic energy bolts per round, each capable of inflicting a wide variety of harmful effects.~

@60911 = ~Vital Essence Refuge~

@60912 = ~Vital Essence Refuge (Necromancy)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

When casting this spell, the mage transfers their vital essence into a small part of their body, usually the little finger of their non-dominant hand or a toe.

As long as this part of their body remains unharmed, no injury to any other part of their body can kill them. For the duration of the spell, they can never be reduced below 1 hit point.

However, if their body is severely injured and their hit points fall below 10% of their maximum, they enter a catatonic state that prevents them from taking any action until someone else tends to their wounds.~

@60913 = ~Agenor Parcilofann's War Harness~

@60914 = ~Agenor Parcilofann's War Harness (Alteration-Abjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell is a special version of Simbul's Spell Sequencer, designed by Agenor to help him survive his travels across the many planes he has visited. Upon casting, the mage gains the benefits of five spells prepared in advance:

Tenser's Transformation
Sovereign Body
Troll Resistance
Improved Haste
Antimagic Shell.~

@609143 = ~Troll Resistance~

@609144 = ~Antimagic Shell~

@609149 = ~Agenor Parcilofann's War Harness (Alteration-Abjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell is a special version of Simbul's Spell Sequencer. Upon casting, the mage gains the benefits of five spells prepared in advance:

Tenser's Transformation
Sovereign Body
Troll Resistance
Improved Haste
Antimagic Shell.~

@60915 = ~Time Control~

@60916 = ~Time Control (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 10-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the caster creates a temporal bubble around themselves, granting them partial control over the flow of time; they can slow it down or accelerate it to a certain extent. While under the effects of this spell, the mage:

Gains Improved Haste and -2 to casting time.
Slows all enemies within 10 meters of them (no saving throw).
Hastes all allies within 10 meters of them.
Doubles the duration of all spells they cast.
Is immune to Slow effects.
Starting at level 27, is also immune to Time Stop.~

@6091699 = ~Time Control (Alteration)

Level: Quest
Sphere: Time
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 10-meter radius
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the caster creates a temporal bubble around themselves, granting them partial control over the flow of time; they can slow it down or accelerate it to a certain extent. While under the effects of this spell, the caster:

Gains Improved Haste and -2 to casting time.
Slows all enemies within 10 meters of them (no saving throw).
Hastes all allies within 10 meters of them.
Doubles the duration of all spells they cast.
Is immune to Slow effects.
Starting at level 27, is also immune to Time Stop.~

@60917 = ~Greater Magic Conversion~

@60918 = ~Greater Magic Conversion (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 1 turn
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell is Salyvia's clumsy attempt to improve Alabastine's famous spell, "Magic Conversion." The improvement can be considered successful, as it allows the caster to endlessly cast spells of higher levels than the original spell, but it has lost stability in the process: the level of the spells that this new spell allows the caster to memorize is not fixed.

By casting this spell, the mage creates a powerful aura of diffuse magic around themselves, which can be used to continuously fuel their lower-level spells. The spell allows them to randomly memorize a level 1 to 4 spell every 3 seconds.~

@609189 = ~Greater Magic Conversion (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 1 round per level
Casting Time: 1 turn
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

By casting this spell, the mage creates a powerful aura of diffuse magic around themselves, which can be used to continuously fuel their lower-level spells. The spell allows them to randomly memorize a level 1 to 4 spell every 3 seconds.~

@609181 = ~A level 1 spell has been memorized~

@609182 = ~A level 2 spell has been memorized~

@609183 = ~A level 3 spell has been memorized~

@609184 = ~A level 4 spell has been memorized~

@60919 = ~Hand of the Devil~

@60920 = ~Hand of the Devil (Necromancy)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell imbues each finger of the mage's dominant hand with the power of Finger of Death, granting them five uses in total.

Each finger can be used once, with a casting time of 1, during the spell's duration. Once used, that finger is drained of its power and returns to normal.~

@60923 = ~Faerie Globe of Invulnerability~

@60924 = ~Faerie Globe of Invulnerability (Abjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Déorie created this spell spontaneously one day when she and her friends were confronted by dangerous rakshasas. Knowing their habit of relying on low-level spells, she wanted to be able to protect her friends. She modified a Globe of Invulnerability by casting it at a higher level and imbuing it with her half-fey essence. The result exceeded her expectations, and she and her friends were able to return safely from their expedition.

This spell is an improved version of Globe of Invulnerability, which blocks low- and mid-level spells, with the following enhancements:

- Blocks spells up to level 6.
- Upon casting, all allies within 4.5 meters are protected by Minor Globe of Invulnerability.~

@609249 = ~Faerie Globe of Invulnerability (Abjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell is an improved version of Globe of Invulnerability, which blocks low- and mid-level spells, with the following enhancements:

- Blocks spells up to level 6.
- Upon casting, all allies within 4.5 meters are protected by Minor Globe of Invulnerability.~

@6092499 = ~Faerie Globe of Invulnerability (Abjuration)

Level: Quest
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell protects the priest against all spells of levels 1 through 6, and protects all allies within 4.5 meters against spells of levels 1 through 3.~

@60925 = ~Elixir of Life~

@60926 = ~Elixir of Life (Alteration, Necromancy)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a powerful healing elixir in the caster's inventory. The elixir can be given to any creature and, when consumed, completely restores the drinker's health and cures all afflictions affecting them.

The elixir remains in the caster's inventory for 24 hours. If it has not been consumed by then, it disappears.~

@6092699 = ~Elixir of Life (Alteration, Necromancy)

Level: Quest
Sphere: Healing
Range: 0
Duration: 1 day
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates a powerful healing elixir in the caster's inventory. The elixir can be given to any creature and, when consumed, completely restores the drinker's health and cures all afflictions affecting them.

The elixir remains in the caster's inventory for 24 hours. If it has not been consumed by then, it disappears.~

@60927 = ~Nix's Explosive Doubles~

@60928 = ~Nix's Explosive Doubles (Illusion/Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates three illusory doubles that function exactly like those created by the 6th-level version of this spell. However, when destroyed, they explode in Solar Fire, dealing 8d6 fire damage to all creatures within the area of effect (save vs. spells at -2 for half damage).~

@60929 = ~Bombardment~

@60930 = ~Bombardment (Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: Sight range
Duration: 1 round per 4 levels
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell causes small flaming meteors to rain down upon the target when cast and once per round thereafter. Each bombardment deals 6d6 crushing damage and 4d6 fire damage to the target and all creatures within 1.5 meters of it.

Each creature affected must make a saving throw vs. spells for half damage each time a bombardment occurs. For creatures with Magic Resistance, a separate Magic Resistance check is made for each bombardment.

The maximum duration of this spell is 7 rounds at caster level 28.~

@6093099 = ~Bombardment (Evocation)

Level: 7
Sphere: Elemental: Fire
Range: Sight range
Duration: 1 round per 4 levels
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: 1/2

This spell rains small flaming meteors upon the target when cast and once per round thereafter. With each bombardment, the target and all creatures within a 1.5-meter radius suffer 6d6 crushing damage and 4d6 fire damage.

Each affected creature must make a saving throw vs. spells with every bombardment; success halves the damage. For creatures with Magic Resistance, a new Magic Resistance check is made for each bombardment.

The spell's maximum duration is 7 rounds at caster level 28.~

@60931 = ~Alabastine's Dweomeric Fusion Device~

@60932 = ~Alabastine's Dweomeric Fusion Device (Conjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows several spells to be combined to make them more powerful. After casting this spell, the mage may choose three spells of 7th level or lower. A special ability is then granted, allowing the mage to cast the three enhanced spells simultaneously, with their duration and damage increased by 35%.~

@60933 = ~Pragadon's Universal Dweomer~

@60934 = ~Pragadon's Universal Dweomer (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

The mage who casts this spell can shape its energy into any existing spell of 1st to 8th level, even if the spell is not in his spellbook.

The chosen spell has no casting time and is cast instantly. If the mage has the chosen spell memorized, it is expended from his memorized spells; otherwise, the spell is cast for free without consuming a spell slot.~

@60935 = ~Weird~

@60936 = ~Weird (Illusion)

Level: 9
Range: Sight range
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 4.5-meter radius
Saving Throw: Special

All enemies within the area designated by the mage lose 1d4 points of Strength for 1 turn and are held for 1 round.

Those who fail a saving throw vs. spells are also confronted with a horrifying manifestation of their worst nightmare. They must then make a saving throw vs. death. If they fail, they die of fright. If they succeed, the psychological shock is nevertheless so severe that they suffer 8d6 damage.~

@609361 = ~1 point of Strength lost~

@609362 = ~2 points of Strength lost~

@609363 = ~3 points of Strength lost~

@609364 = ~4 points of Strength lost~

@60937 = ~Vampiric Bodyguard~

@60938 = ~Vampiric Bodyguard (Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 9
Range: Sight range
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates an Aerial Servant and binds it to the mage. This costs the mage 20 hit points, which are deducted from his maximum hit points for as long as the Aerial Servant remains bound to him. The Aerial Servant then behaves like a familiar: it can follow its summoner into all areas and only disappears upon its death. Whenever it attacks and hits, it drains 2 hit points, which are restored to the mage.

The mage can control only one Vampiric Bodyguard at a time. When it dies, the caster regains the 20 hit points invested in it and may freely summon another one.~

@609381 = ~You can only control one Vampiric Bodyguard~

@60939 = ~Beholder~

@60940 = ~Beholder (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: 0
Duration: 4 turns
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transforms the caster into a Beholder. While in this form, the caster can no longer cast spells or use weapons or quick items, but can attack five times per round with its eyes. Each eye attack randomly produces one of the following effects:

* Paralysis
* Fear
* Serious Wound
* Petrification
* Domination
* Slow
* Death
* Disintegration

All of these effects except Serious Wound can be avoided by the target with the appropriate saving throw.

The caster can also use Anti-Magic Ray at will, dispelling magic from the target.

The caster may end the spell at any time to return to their normal form. Otherwise, the transformation lasts for 4 turns.~

@60941 = ~Golem Control~

@60942 = ~Golem Control (Alteration)

Level: 9
Range: Sight range
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: One golem
Saving Throw: Negates

This spell allows the mage to attempt to take control of an enemy golem. If the targeted golem fails a saving throw vs. spells at -2, its allegiance changes and it becomes the property of the caster.

The golem can then follow its new master into other areas.

This spell has no effect on anything other than a golem.~
